// A list of APIs to call from the Ara Web
// 
// Creating an RPC
// There are three types of RPCs
//  - proxy
//  - extension
//  - independent
//
// Some are included in the website, some are listed from the blockchain. Other RPCs could be remote servers outside of Ara.
// Whenever you write an API, make it available for all by registering it in Ara Blockchain.
// The RPCs provides an ABI. ABI for the apps could accept Resource and output another resource.
//
// For example:
//  Name: redirect
//  Type: extension
//  ClientCode: {JS code}
//  Definition: Redirects to another page
//  Input: ["https://atomic.ara.foundation/classes/url"]
// 
// For example an RPC to use for "Create Community" action. 
//  Input: [list of resources]
//  Output: [list of new resources]
